      <title>潮汕蚝仔烙：小只生蚝配番薯粉和猪油猛火煎出正宗口感</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek001/post/20260907/%E6%BD%AE%E6%B1%95%E8%9A%9D%E4%BB%94%E7%83%99%E5%B0%8F%E5%8F%AA%E7%94%9F%E8%9A%9D%E9%85%8D%E7%95%AA%E8%96%AF%E7%B2%89%E5%92%8C%E7%8C%AA%E6%B2%B9%E7%8C%9B%E7%81%AB%E7%85%8E%E5%87%BA%E6%AD%A3%E5%AE%97%E5%8F%A3%E6%84%9F/</link>
